{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "05ab93d9-e084-8295-beef-843cef1863f5",
  "created_at": "2026-02-25T14:45:15-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Rui Correia",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T14:43:12-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T14:43:16-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello. Yes. My name is Rui Correia. I want to report a tree. It is down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T14:43:22-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, a downed tree. Where is the tree, Mr. Correia?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T14:43:26-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is on Annandale Road. Number 210. In the North End. [line breaks up] ...the roots, they come up from the ground. All the roots, you can see."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T14:43:36-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm sorry, you broke up a little. You said 210 Annandale Road, and the roots pulled up out of the ground. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T14:43:45-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, yes. Correct. It happen after the storm. The nor'easter, last weekend. Saturday into Sunday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T14:43:51-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Is the tree on the road, or on a house or wires?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T14:43:56-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Is on the grass, by the sidewalk. Some of it on the sidewalk. No wires, I think. [inaudible] Daddy, big tree! Sorry. My daughter, she is at the window. She tell me everything she see."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T14:44:09-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "She says the tree is lying down, and the dirt is standing up. Yes, she is right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T14:44:16-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine. So whose tree is it, do you know? Is it on city property or a private yard?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T14:44:23-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I do not know. I am the neighbor. This is my question. Who I call? The city, the owner, or the electric company? Please, who handles it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T14:44:33-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good question. If it's a city street tree between the sidewalk and the road, that's us, and I can take the report now. If it's in a private yard, the owner has to deal with it. The utility only comes if wires are involved."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T14:44:49-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Please say again. The city is for the street tree?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T14:44:54-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. City is for the street tree. Owner for a private yard. Utility only for wires. I'll put in a report so someone can look and see which it is."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T14:45:05-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, thank you. My number is 401-555-0171."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T14:45:08-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0171, and the address is 210 Annandale Road. Someone will check it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T14:45:13-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
